# GymAct TOGAF public-ontology alignment ABox.
#
# Searched/reused vocabularies: W3C PROF, PROV-O, ORG, SKOS, DCAT,
# DCTERMS, ODRL; P-PLAN; OASIS OSLC RM. SHACL/EARL courts are in
# shapes.ttl. No local OWL/RDFS class/property is required.
#
# Source fence: this graph does not reproduce TOGAF definitions, diagrams,
# templates, or body text. Public Open Group pages are provenance only.

